                "title": "5 Inch Kickdown Door Stop",
                "description": "Solid Brass 5 Inch Kickdown Door Holder Deltana DHK5 - The 5 Inch Kickdown Door Stop mounts to the lower surface of the door to keep it in an open position. When not in use, it flips up and out of the way. This kickdown door holder is made of solid brass by Deltana, It includes a non-skid easily replaceable rubber tip to protect the floor and is supplied with mounting screws. Available in 9 great finishes.\r\n",
